<!-- ============ 이벤트 ============ -->
<section class="reveal mt-10">
  <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
    <span class="text-3xl wobble inline-block">🎉</span>
    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl"><span class="marker">통일로 이벤트</span></h2>
  </div>

  <!-- ⭐ 메인 이벤트: 고기파티 -->
  <div class="grill-glow relative mt-4 overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border-[3px] border-[var(--ink)] text-white"
       style="background:radial-gradient(130% 95% at 78% -5%, rgba(255,214,10,.9), transparent 52%), linear-gradient(155deg,#ff9e00 0%,#ff5d73 100%)">
    <!-- 불씨 -->
    <span class="ember" style="left:22%; animation-duration:3.2s"></span>
    <span class="ember" style="left:48%; animation-duration:2.6s; animation-delay:.6s"></span>
    <span class="ember" style="left:70%; animation-duration:3.6s; animation-delay:1.1s"></span>
    <span class="ember" style="left:86%; animation-duration:2.9s; animation-delay:.3s"></span>

    <!-- 메인 배지 -->
    <div class="absolute top-3 right-3 z-10 tag bg-[var(--ink)] text-[var(--sun)] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-extrabold rotate-3 wobble">⭐ 오늘의 메인</div>

    <div class="relative z-10 p-5">
      <div class="text-6xl sizzle inline-block drop-shadow-[2px_4px_0_rgba(6,48,71,.45)]">🥩</div>
      <h3 class="font-display text-[40px] leading-none mt-1 drop-shadow-[2px_3px_0_rgba(6,48,71,.4)]">고기파티 🔥</h3>
      <p class="font-round text-lg mt-2 text-white/95 leading-snug">현장에서 <b>지글지글</b> 직접 구워 먹는<br>이게 진짜 오늘의 <b>하이라이트!</b> 🤤</p>

      <div class="mt-4 space-y-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-white text-[var(--ink)] rounded-2xl p-3 shadow-[2px_2px_0_rgba(6,48,71,.25)]">
          <span class="text-xl">🛒</span>
          <p class="font-round text-[15px] leading-snug"><b>장보기는 전날 미리!</b> <b>장보기 멤버</b> 꾸려서 장볼 예정이에요. 먹고 싶은 <b>먹거리</b>는 <b class="text-[var(--coral)]">단톡방에서</b> 취합해요 🛒</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-white text-[var(--ink)] rounded-2xl p-3 shadow-[2px_2px_0_rgba(6,48,71,.25)]">
          <span class="text-xl">🍻</span>
          <p class="font-round text-[15px] leading-snug">간단한 <b>주류</b> 한잔 생각 있으면 <b class="text-[var(--coral)]">단톡방에 말씀</b>해주세요~</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-4 text-center bg-[var(--ink)]/90 rounded-2xl py-3 px-4">
        <p class="font-round text-lg text-white leading-snug">7시 강습 식구들 <b class="text-[var(--sun)]">다 같이 모여</b><br>고기 굽고 단합! <b class="text-[var(--sun)]">아자아자 🙌🔥</b></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</section>
